{"id":38836453736336,"type":"artist","name":"Los del Río","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":23,"info":{"img":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Los_del_R%C3%ADo.jpg?width=500","bio":"Los del Río es un dúo musical Antonio Romero Monge y Rafael Ruiz. Son originarios de Dos Hermanas (Sevilla). Como dúo, Romero y Ruiz han actuado (y continúan) desde el principio de la década de los 60. Ellos ya eran conocidos en el sur de España cuando editaron la canción «Macarena», pero a raíz de esta lo fueron mundialmente.\n\nSu especialidad es la música folclore, en especial las sevillanas, la más típica de Sevilla. Por un tiempo, Los del Río actuaban en las «fiestas» privadas de Marbella y Madrid.","tags":["dance","spanish","world","español","spain"]},"works":[{"id":193864611580397,"type":"album","name":"Luces de Sevilla","artist":"Los del Río","year":1967,"weight":5,"yt":"JZHf0XLId0Y","src":"musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":264735744230394,"name":"RYM Top — Folk — Sevillanas","rank":40,"scaruffi":null},{"id":21596927198085,"name":"RYM Top — Folk — Andalusian Folk Music","rank":65,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":2}},{"id":2393013700691,"type":"album","name":"De Triana al Rocío con Los del Río","artist":"Los del Río","year":1971,"weight":5,"yt":"0aqoGCO7Zcg","src":"musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":264735744230394,"name":"RYM Top — Folk — Sevillanas","rank":30,"scaruffi":null},{"id":21596927198085,"name":"RYM Top — Folk — Andalusian Folk Music","rank":49,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":2}},{"id":144311142699411,"type":"album","name":"Sevillanas y rumbas","artist":"Los del Río","year":1972,"weight":5,"yt":"0aqoGCO7Zcg","src":"musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":264735744230394,"name":"RYM Top — Folk — Sevillanas","rank":41,"scaruffi":null},{"id":21596927198085,"name":"RYM Top — Folk — Andalusian Folk Music","rank":66,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":2}},{"id":172416002650539,"type":"album","name":"Sevillana